ss="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/pun-thao/">Pun Thao Kong A Shrine</a></h3><p>Faith in the old port area</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/kue-chai/"><img src="/assets/kue-chai.webp" alt="ศาลเจ้ากู่ใช่ตึ๋ง" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">10</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/kue-chai/">Kue Chai Tung Shrine</a></h3><p>A space for people's hopes</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="shrine" data-name="โรงเจในสวน"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/rong-jae/"><img src="/assets/rong-jae.webp" alt="โรงเจในสวน" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">11</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Shrines & Vegetarian Halls</span><h3><a href="/en/places/rong-jae/">The Shrine in the Garden</a></h3><p>Traditions passed down through places</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="สะพานเหล็กบุญสูง"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/iron-bridge/"><img src="/assets/iron-bridge.webp" alt="สะพานเหล็กบุญสูง" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">16</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Old Buildings & City Traces</span><h3><a href="/en/places/iron-bridge/">Boon Soong Iron Bridge</a></h3><p>Iron structure connecting mining stories</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="heritage" data-name="กำแพงจวนเจ้าเมืองตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/governor-wall/"><img src="/assets/governor-wall.webp" alt="กำแพงจวนเจ้าเมืองต